   - The Software is for personal use by the person who installs it, under one PC license, on one PC, in one car and with one remote. Using additional remotes requires a separate purchase.
   - The right to use paid features is a term subscription (monthly) and covers the subscription period. The free trial period and the price are as shown on the purchase screen, and the subscription renews automatically until you cancel it.
   - A license key is issued for use on one PC.
   - The Developer may change the price, scope or delivery method of future versions; changed terms apply after notice under Article 13. No additional charge is made retroactively for a subscription period that has already been paid.

